* ASP.Net Core docs: [CookieOptions.HttpOnly Property](https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/api/microsoft.aspnetcore.http.cookieoptions.httponly).
* MDN: [Set-Cookie](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/Headers/Set-Cookie) Header.
* Web Forms docs: [HttpCookie.HttpOnly Property](https://msdn.microsoft.com/en-us/library/system.web.httpcookie.httponly(v=vs.110).aspx).
* Web Forms docs: [httpCookies Element](https://msdn.microsoft.com/library/ms228262%28v=vs.100%29.aspx).
* PortSwigger: [Cookie without HttpOnly flag set](https://portswigger.net/kb/issues/00500600_cookie-without-httponly-flag-set)
* Common Weakness Enumeration: [CWE-1004](https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/1004.html).

